  "note": "Triads on all four string sets together, inside a few frets in G: the 1st chord on each set up and back, then the 1st, 4th and 5th chords on one set after another, then a new set every bar. The chords are tokens, counted the long way once. Moves holds only a tempo range: the grips' frets would drop an octave part-way in some keys, so the key stays G.",
